  "content": {
    "title": "Dan Hurley stunned to learn Dusty May's real age ahead of Michigan-UConn",
    "text": "Dan Hurley has been the head coach of the UConn Huskies men's basketball team since 2018. Under Hurley, the Huskies won back-to-back national championships in 2023 and 2024 and will appear in their third men's NCAA Tournament National Championship game in four years on Monday night.No. 2 UConn will have to go through Michigan head coach Dusty May and his No. 1 Wolverines to win a third national title.May is only in his second season in Ann Arbor, and Hurley was taken aback to learn that May isn't that much younger than he is.MILWAUKEE, WISCONSIN - MARCH 07: Head coach Dan Hurley of the Connecticut Huskies reacts during the first half against the Marquette Golden Eagles at ...\"This is a coach who's very confident, very secure in what he does in every way,\" Hurley told reporters on Sunday. \"So, yeah, I mean, you're looking at — uh, I didn't realize how old he was. He's 49 years old? He looks really young. I thought he was younger than that.\"Hurley continued, \"I mean, 49, I was surprised at that. I thought he would be more in his early 40s. I thought he might have been 40 or 41. His hair — he looks great. But he's one of the best coaches. He'll be one of the best coaches. Hopefully, this is the first of many meetings in these big spots between me and Dusty. He's excellent.\"Hurley, for the record, is 53.The Field of 68's Jeff Goodman posted a photo of May scouting the first half of UConn's Final Four win over No. 3 Illinois before Michigan routed No. 1 Arizona by a score of 91-73 in their Final Four game on Saturday night.Hurley has a 199-74 overall record at UConn, while May is 63-13 so far. Monday's national championship game will be the first meeting between UConn and Michigan with Hurley and May on the sidelines. The game is scheduled to tip at 8:50 p.m. EST from Lucas Oil Stadium in Indianapolis.",
